    <string name="help_kor_title">Small business scheme (KOR)</string>
    <string name="help_kor_body">Under € 20,000 turnover a year you can opt out of charging BTW. Apply with the Belastingdienst first; invoices must then not show BTW.</string>
    <string name="help_eu_title">Clients in other EU countries</string>
    <string name="help_eu_body">Services to a business in another EU country are usually 0% BTW (reverse charge). Add their BTW number to the invoice.</string>
    <string name="help_keep_title">Keep your invoices 7 years</string>
    <string name="help_keep_body">Dutch tax rules require you to keep your administration for 7 years. Export your PDFs and store them safely.</string>
